  "sourceTitle": "Fruit Cocktail Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Fruit Cocktail Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 12:46am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon Cornstarch\n1/4 cup Sugar\n1 can Fruit cocktail\n1/2 cup Orange juice\n2 tablespoons Lemon juice\n cup Raisins\n1/8 teaspoon Cloves\nMaraschino cherries (opt)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix cornstarch and sugar in a pan. Add syrup drained from the fruit cocktail and the orange and lemon juices. Cook 5 minutes, stirring constantly. Remove from heat and add fruit and cloves.",
